# Captured upstream responses whose exact bytes are the thing under test.
#
# packages/html-digest's fixtures are two real fetches of an Aetna policy page,
# and its tests assert which bytes differ between them and what their digests
# are. With core.autocrlf on (the Windows default) git would rewrite their line
# endings on checkout, silently turning a byte-exact capture into something the
# payer never published. -text switches that conversion off for them alone.
packages/html-digest/tests/fixtures/aetna/*.html -text
